=====Bronius's subordinate=====
[[File:Bronius subordinate Adventures.png|thumb|130px|Bronius's subordinate in Pokémon Adventures]]
In ''[[PS478|Big City Battles]]'', [[Bronius]]'s subordinate knocked {{adv|Bianca}} unconscious in order to liberate her {{p|Litwick}}. After tracking the Grunt's tracks with Musha, Black and his friends found Bronius and his subordinates with a group of Pokémon liberated from their Trainers. Bronius and his subordinates were eventually defeated, forcing them to escape while leaving the stolen Pokémon behind.

=====Rood's subordinates=====
[[File:Rood subordinates Adventures.png|thumb|200px|Rood's subordinates in Pokémon Adventures]]
[[File:Rood subordinates casual Adventures.png|thumb|left|200px|Two of Rood's subordinates out of their uniforms in Pokémon Adventures]]
Rood's subordinates appeared in ''[[PS480|At Liberty on Liberty Garden]]'', where they were tasked with capturing {{p|Victini}} at [[Liberty Garden]]. By using {{p|Gothitelle}}'s {{m|Hypnosis}}, the Grunts kept the people on the island at bay, preventing them from interfering with Victini's capture. Black and White arrived on Liberty Garden tasked with gathering information on Victini, only to find it injured, having avoided the Grunts' capture for three days. By being infused with Victini's power, Black's [[Brav]] defeated the Grunts' Pokémon, forcing the Grunts to flee.

In ''[[PS536|Cold Storage Battle]]'', two Grunts were seen in a flashback of Whitley's time as a member of Team Plasma.

In ''[[PS539|Frozen World]]'', two of Rood's subordinates appeared alongside Rood at Castelia City, which had just been frozen over by the [[Plasma Frigate]]. There, they met with {{adv|Whitley}}, who revealed that Hugh, a classmate of hers, had found the pendant containing the memory card that could counteract the Colress Machine. After searching Hugh's person, the Grunts discovered that he did not actually have the memory card on hand, which makes Whitley realize it must still be back at the Trainers' School. Whitley is reluctant to leave her classmates behind due to the danger presented by the Plasma Frigate, so Rood commands his subordinates to stay behind to protect the class. Rood also reveals a {{TP|N|Zorua}} that was friends with N and has it {{a|Illusion|transform}} into Whitley so that her classmates may be fooled into thinking she is still with them.

In ''[[PS541|Pink Slip]]'', the two subordinates assisted Whitley's classmates at the [[Marine Tube]] alongside N's Zorua, still disguised as Whitley. There, they helped the class warm themselves up from the cold created from Castelia's freezing.

In ''[[PS545|Deduction Time]]'', the third subordinate was seen operating the machine designed to counteract the [[Colress Machine]] once the memory card was successfully delivered.

