In ''[[PS531|Unforgettable Memories]]'', Giallo's subordinates are revealed to have attacked Hugh as a child and stole the {{p|Purrloin}} he gave to his [[Hugh's sister|younger sister]]. This was the very first liberation done by Team Plasma.

In ''[[PS547|The Final Battle]]'', Giallo's subordinates appeared as members of the black Team Plasma. They tried to convince other Grunts to stay and fight {{adv|Whitley}}, {{adv|N}}, and Hugh as they raided the [[Plasma Frigate]]. When Hugh noticed them, he decided to stay behind and fight the Grunts as revenge for what happened to him five years ago. Hugh easily beat the Grunts, but one refused to give up and sent out a liberated {{p|Snivy}} to continue the battle. Snivy refused to fight Hugh, choosing to side with him instead. Defeated, the Grunts immediately surrendered.

